# Raw profiler captures — never commit these. Nothing reads them; the derived
# tables next to them (ops.csv, perf_report*.csv, *_perf_report.txt) are the evidence.
# Across mvasiljevic/qb2/skillexp/** these five patterns reached 5.43 GB in 267 blobs.
*.tracy
tracy_ops_times.csv
tracy_ops_times.csv.gz
profile_log_device.csv
profile_log_device.csv.gz

# Converted-weight cache (also covered by the repo-root *.tensorbin rule)
weight_cache/

# Raw candidate dumps and advisor pipeline logs: nothing reads them and they are
# tens of MiB each. The derived tables (report.json/report.txt, ops CSVs,
# perf_report*, reconciliation JSON) are the evidence and are kept.
# These were purged from history once after a git add -A re-introduced them;
# a one-time exclusion is not durable, an ignore rule is.
**/artifacts/candidates/stack_*_b32.json
**/shard_advise/*/pipeline.log
